\title{DFS solves connectivity}
\date{2026-09-18T13:12:29Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\tag{draft}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{Assuming all vertices start out unvisited, #{\DFS(G,s)} ends up visiting #{t} if and only if #{s} and #{t} are [connected](00LT).}

